WEBVTT

00:06:40.083 --> 00:07:07.458
(Music)

00:07:07.458 --> 00:07:09.875
And a thousand years later,

00:07:09.875 --> 00:07:13.885
this impulse to notate took an entirely different form.

00:07:13.885 --> 00:07:15.250
And you can see how this happened

00:07:15.250 --> 00:07:21.833
in these excerpts from the Christmas mass "Puer Natus est nobis,"

00:07:21.833 --> 00:07:24.208
"For Us is Born."

00:07:24.208 --> 00:07:28.841
(Music)

00:07:28.841 --> 00:07:31.083
In the 10th century, little squiggles were used